<title>SHARJAH: CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT ZIMBABWE BY 32 RUNS IN SHARJAH CUP.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT ZIMBABWE BY 32 RUNS IN SHARJAH CUP.</headline>
<dateline>SHARJAH, United Arab Emirates 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan</p>
<p>beat Zimbabwe by 32 runs on Wednesday to reach the final of the</p>
<p>Sharjah Cup cricket tournament.</p>
<p>Scores: Pakistan 151 for nine, innings closed; Zimbabwe 119</p>
<p>in 40.1 overs.</p>
</text>
